{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only engineer on an autonomous cargo ship \ud83d\udea2 drifting through the South China Sea \ud83c\udf0a after a system failure \u26a1. Engines are silent, communication is lost, and you are left alone, trying to survive and maybe laugh at your situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a challenge, and every container may hold something useful, strange, or hilariously unexpected. Food, tools, weapons, and bizarre items all await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and base building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft tools, weapons, and shelters. Furnish your cabin \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f and create safe spaces for rest and storing your loot. Broken parts of the ship can also be repurposed for repairs and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and system repair</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair malfunctioning mechanisms, solve logic puzzles, and try to regain control of the ship. Attention, ingenuity, and engineering skills are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement and transport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find vehicles like small boats and trolleys to explore the ship faster and access hard-to-reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Health and threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor hunger, thirst, fatigue, seasickness, and injuries. First aid kits and medicine help recovery, but dangers like wildlife attacks and accidents lurk on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental state and self-irony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness affects your sanity. Hallucinations and strange sounds can make ordinary objects appear terrifying or comical. Every decision is both a risk and an opportunity for self-irony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship or embrace the drift and enjoy the adventure. Will you survive and become the legend of a ship full of strange finds, puzzles, and unexpected humor? Add <strong>30 Days. Alone. Adrift.</strong> to your wishlist and show the ocean \ud83c\udf0a that an engineer can survive\u2026 with style and humor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698540?t=1771510432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/5271b253b679f28a74add135810c65872e6feef5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771510432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/0ee5f960e910d01a3e56aeac061b02d79c542d7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771510432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/0ee5f960e910d01a3e56aeac061b02d79c542d7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771510432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only engineer on an autonomous cargo ship \ud83d\udea2 drifting through the South China Sea \ud83c\udf0a after a system failure \u26a1. Engines are silent, communication is lost, and you are left alone, trying to survive and maybe laugh at your situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a challenge, and every container may hold something useful, strange, or hilariously unexpected. Food, tools, weapons, and bizarre items all await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and base building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft tools, weapons, and shelters. Furnish your cabin \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f and create safe spaces for rest and storing your loot. Broken parts of the ship can also be repurposed for repairs and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and system repair</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair malfunctioning mechanisms, solve logic puzzles, and try to regain control of the ship. Attention, ingenuity, and engineering skills are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement and transport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find vehicles like small boats and trolleys to explore the ship faster and access hard-to-reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Health and threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor hunger, thirst, fatigue, seasickness, and injuries. First aid kits and medicine help recovery, but dangers like wildlife attacks and accidents lurk on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental state and self-irony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness affects your sanity. Hallucinations and strange sounds can make ordinary objects appear terrifying or comical. Every decision is both a risk and an opportunity for self-irony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship or embrace the drift and enjoy the adventure. Will you survive and become the legend of a ship full of strange finds, puzzles, and unexpected humor? Add <strong>30 Days. Alone. Adrift.</strong> to your wishlist and show the ocean \ud83c\udf0a that an engineer can survive\u2026 with style and humor.</p>","developers":["Saito Soki"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/3891217943542bba12142a945c7f6fe06a588baa/header.jpg?t=1771510432","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"30 DAYS. ALONE. ADRIFT.","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Saito Soki"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/14d8f5e22b51f3da83c5510611cea85552b3dc73/ss_14d8f5e22b51f3da83c5510611cea85552b3dc73.1920x1080.jpg?t=177